<title>FINLAND: Foreign ownership in Huhtamaki lower.</title>
<headline>Foreign ownership in Huhtamaki lower.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign ownership of Finnish companies registered in the Central Share Register (OKR) was 26.4 percent of shares in issue at end-September compared to 26.3 percent at end-August, OKR said in its monthly review.</p>
<p>Foreign ownership in confectionery and packaging materials group Huhtamaki Oy fell to 29 percent by the end of September from 39 percent a month earlier, OKR said.</p>
